1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,554
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,554 --> 00:00:03,525
Let's learn opposites!

3
00:00:04,075 --> 00:00:05,454
Up and down!

4
00:00:05,454 --> 00:00:06,925
Hot and cold!

5
00:00:08,625 --> 00:00:11,200
The balloon goes up, up, up!

6
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,400
The ball falls down, down, down!

7
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,026
Up and down!

8
00:00:16,026 --> 00:00:17,825
They are opposites!

9
00:00:19,525 --> 00:00:21,675
The cocoa is hot.

10
00:00:22,075 --> 00:00:23,967
The snowman is cold.

11
00:00:23,967 --> 00:00:24,625
Brrr!

12
00:00:25,025 --> 00:00:26,373
Hot and cold!

13
00:00:26,373 --> 00:00:28,225
They are opposites!

14
00:00:29,925 --> 00:00:32,225
This face is happy.

15
00:00:32,625 --> 00:00:34,825
This face is sad.

16
00:00:35,225 --> 00:00:36,555
Happy and sad!

17
00:00:36,555 --> 00:00:38,275
They are opposites!

18
00:00:39,975 --> 00:00:42,125
The box is open.

19
00:00:42,525 --> 00:00:44,675
The box is closed.

20
00:00:45,075 --> 00:00:46,592
Open and closed!

21
00:00:46,592 --> 00:00:48,349
They are opposites!

22
00:00:50,049 --> 00:00:52,099
The cup is full.

23
00:00:52,499 --> 00:00:54,649
The cup is empty.

24
00:00:55,049 --> 00:00:56,500
Full and empty!

25
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,274
They are opposites!

26
00:00:59,974 --> 00:01:01,057
In the day,

27
00:01:01,057 --> 00:01:02,449
