30
00:01:05,549 --> 00:01:06,824
Day and night!

31
00:01:06,824 --> 00:01:08,473
They are opposites!

32
00:01:10,173 --> 00:01:12,073
The car is fast.

33
00:01:12,073 --> 00:01:12,873
Zoom!

34
00:01:13,273 --> 00:01:15,548
The snail is slow.

35
00:01:15,948 --> 00:01:17,310
Fast and slow!

36
00:01:17,310 --> 00:01:19,072
They are opposites!

37
00:01:20,772 --> 00:01:23,172
What is the opposite of hot?

38
00:01:25,372 --> 00:01:26,896
Cold!

39
00:01:28,596 --> 00:01:31,146
What is the opposite of fast?

40
00:01:33,346 --> 00:01:34,772
Slow!

41
00:01:36,472 --> 00:01:39,320
