47
00:01:55,470 --> 00:01:57,970
Can you find hot and cold?

48
00:02:00,170 --> 00:02:02,394
Hot and cold!

49
00:02:02,944 --> 00:02:04,894
That's right!

50
00:02:06,594 --> 00:02:09,144
Can you find happy and sad?

51
00:02:11,344 --> 00:02:13,443
Happy and sad!

52
00:02:13,993 --> 00:02:16,018
Great job!

53
00:02:17,718 --> 00:02:20,393
Can you find open and closed?

54
00:02:22,593 --> 00:02:24,918
Open and closed!

55
00:02:25,468 --> 00:02:27,443
You got it!

56
00:02:29,143 --> 00:02:31,818
Can you find full and empty?

57
00:02:34,018 --> 00:02:36,292
Full and empty!

58
00:02:36,842 --> 00:02:38,542
Super!

59
00:02:40,242 --> 00:02:42,667
Can you find day and night?

60
00:02:44,867 --> 00:02:46,892
Day and night!

61
00:02:47,442 --> 00:02:49,092
Hooray!

62
00:02:50,792 --> 00:02:53,367
Can you find fast and slow?

63
00:02:55,567 --> 00:02:57,816
Fast and slow!

64
00:02:58,366 --> 00:03:00,666
Yes! Well done!

65
00:03:02,366 --> 00:03:05,391
Wow! You remembered everything!

66
00:03:07,241 --> 00:03:09,891
You are a super learner!

67
00:03:11,591 --> 00:03:14,391
Great job, little learner!

68
00:03:14,941 --> 00:03:16,893
Share Mimzi with a friend,

69
00:03:16,893 --> 00:03:19,516
